Neovim: Select word and change                | viw c
Neovim: Go to the last edit                   | g;
Neovim: Go forward to the next edit           | g,
Neovim: Undo/redo                             | u / C-r
Neovim: Scoll up/down half a page             | C-u/d
Neovim: LSP hover (User)                      | <leader>K


